    "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added a Legacy Lists diagnostic section to detect deprecated NIP-51 lists and guide migration or removal. Users can unlock hidden items (when authorized), merge deduplicated tags into modern lists, or delete legacy entries, with per-list progress and completion feedback.\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated README with a \"Planned Reports (Backlog)\" section describing three upcoming diagnostics: relay list hygiene, identifier verification, and Lightning address/zap validation.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
