    "body": "- Introduced a new report section for Blossom servers, including a loader that checks server connectivity and event deletion support.\r\n- Updated the reports page to include the new Blossom servers section alongside existing relay checks.\r\n- Enhanced the UI to display server statuses and provide contextual feedback on connectivity and deletion support.\r\n- Added configuration file for the application with relevant settings.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Blossom server status checking UI with per-server online/offline indicators and management actions.\n  * Event-deletion support indicators for key-package relays with per-relay status and summaries.\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added guidance on a new stream combiner pattern (combine-by-value) and usage recommendations.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Removed Key Package Relays from the dead-relays report.\n  * Added new report sections and wired their loaders/components.\n  * Minor formatting and UI text updates.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
